dataBlocks Place Order, Cancel Order:
Data Cart: A cart of items.
Schema:
{ items: string[] }

Event Order Placed: An order was placed.
Schema:
{
  "total": "integer",
  "id": "string"
}

interfaceSection orders API:
## Interface orders API

The HTTP API of orders.

Schema:
{
  "delete": {
    "path": "/orders/{id}"
  },
  "post": {
    "body": "Cart",
    "path": "/orders"
  }
}

Exposes:
- Place Order (`src/orders/placeOrder.ts`)
- Cancel Order (`src/orders/cancelOrder.ts`)

Requirements:
- Exact Totals: Totals are exact integers of cents.

Guardrails:
- One Writer: Only the API writes orders.
- Missing Rule (definition not found in the record)

